  "historical_output_text": " I used to know this place insideout, from each of the little corners to every crack between cobblingstones of this narrow, winding cove. As my footsteps fell in time, the soft rustles of autumn wind through dead, bare twigs minged in with sounds of my boots crunch against leaves. Each cobbled footpath held a secret that was known, and the secrets themselves seemed like a secret to this familiar place",
